# Phone CLI — Function Design

- NEVER hide `std::process::Command` or sleeps inside domain tables — ALWAYS inject `CommandRunner` / `Wait`.
- NEVER silent `_ =>` on CLI/`Commands` enums — ALWAYS exhaustive `match`.
- NEVER nest past clippy `excessive_nesting` (3) — ALWAYS extract **module-level free fns**.
- NEVER `anyhow` / `Box<dyn Error>` — ALWAYS `thiserror` (`AdbError`, `ConfigError`, …).
- Keep functions under 80 lines (`too_many_lines`).
